// How Come You Do Me (austin/bergere 124)

Tempo 120
Keysig C

Groove Metronome2-4
  z * 2
  
Groove BigbandIntro

Begin Solo
    Voice VoiceOohs
    Volume fff
    Octave 5
    Articulate 50
    Harmony 3below
    Begin Riff
        4c+;r;c+;r;
        4f;r;f;r;
        8c+;;;; 4a;;
        43c+;;; 2c+;
    End
End
Swingmode On   /// only effects solo

1         C
2         F
3        Am
4        C7

Repeat
Groove BigBand
Volume m

5         C      /      F
6         C   Bb7     A7
7        D7      /     G7
8         C    Dm7      /     G7

Groove BigBandPlus
Volume mf

9         C      /      F
10        C    Bb7     A7
11       D7
12       G7

Groove BigBandSus
Volume m

13       C7
14        /
15       F6
16      Ab7

Groove BigBandSusPlus
Volume mf

17        C      /      F
18        C    Bb7     A7

RepeatEnding 3

19       D7      /     G7

Groove BigBandFill
Volume f

20        C

RepeatEnd

Groove BigBandEnd
Chord-hits1 Volume -50%

Decresc p 2


21       D7      /     G7
22        C      z!


